asset:        arimo.rs (the glyph outlines in GLYPHS)
title:        Arimo Bold's outlines of the characters the Timecode effect writes
              (digits and separators), in the font's units
author:       The Arimo Project Authors
source:       https://github.com/googlefonts/arimo
license:      OFL-1.1
license-file: crates/effects/fonts/OFL.txt
added:        2026-10-20 by @acasoq-web
notes:        The quadratic contours and advances of 16 glyphs of Arimo Bold, copied
              from the font into Rust tables and drawn by crates/effects/src/text.rs.
              The packages ship the license as Arimo-OFL.txt.
